; Message ordinary Signal.
;
; A message is just a message: a Priority, a Content, and the flows it is
; for. The sender is never in the payload; Message names it from the peer
; (Flow's ResolvePeer). Message owns the record, the ledger and the
; receipts; Flow is the only pane writer, and Message reaches a pane only
; through Flow's Deliver.
;
; Send vets every recipient first (the first refusal fails the whole
; Send), records the message, then delivers to each recipient and answers
; each one's Receipt. A recipient that is working (Soft) or whose composer
; holds text is Parked, and the message lands when Flow shows it at rest.
;
; Grades stay separate. Submitted: Message accepted and recorded it.
; Parked: waiting for the recipient to rest. Transported: Herdr accepted
; the text for the exact binding. Presented: the recipient was seen
; reacting on the exact pane. Uncertain: text may have reached the pane
; and is never retried by itself (meta Redeliver). Read: the recipient's
; own Acknowledge, the only source of Read. Withdrawn: the sender took a
; parked message back. Refused: Flow refused it.
;
; Withdraw is the sender's, only while parked. Acknowledge is a
; recipient's: the MessageId it names is the one Flow typed at the head of
; the letter, so a recipient reading its own pane can acknowledge without
; being told the id another way. The id is declared once, in
; meta-signal-flow, because Flow renders it into the pane. Observe answers the Receipts on open, then a
; ReceiptObserved for every later grade change.

Signal
[ signal_flow:[ FlowId ] meta_signal_flow:[ MessageId Content BodyRefusal DeliveryRejection InterruptWitness ] ]
[ Send.SendRequest Withdraw.MessageId Acknowledge.MessageId QueryReceipts.MessageId Observe.MessageId ]
[ Submitted.Submission SendRejected.SendRejection Withdrawn.MessageId Acknowledged.MessageId Receipts.Submission ReceiptObserved.Receipt MessageRejected.MessageRejection ]
[ Priority.[ HardAbrupt MiddleAbrupt Soft ]
  SendRequest.{ Vector<FlowId> Priority Content }
  Grade.[ Submitted Parked Transported Presented Uncertain Read Withdrawn Refused.DeliveryRejection ]
  Receipt.{ FlowId InterruptWitness Grade }
  Submission.{ MessageId Vector<Receipt> }
  SendRejection.[ SenderUnknown EmptyRecipients UnknownRecipient.FlowId BodyRefused.{ FlowId BodyRefusal } RecipientRefused.{ FlowId DeliveryRejection } FlowUnreachable StoreRefused ]
  MessageRejection.[ UnknownMessage NotSender NotRecipient NotParked NotUncertain FlowUnreachable StoreRefused ] ]
